# Push after every change

When a code or UI change is finished, commit it and `git push origin HEAD` in the same turn. Do not wait for the user to ask.

- Commit message: 1–2 sentences, why not what, match recent style
- Never commit `.env` or secrets
- Never force-push or skip hooks
- If there is nothing to commit, skip
